{"seq":2,"slug":"integer-combinatorial","title":"第2章：整数与组合优化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/integer-combinatorial","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"integer-programming","title":"整数规划与分支定界：离散决策的精确求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/integer-combinatorial/integer-programming","wordCount":1542,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-optimization","title":"网络优化：流量与路径的最优调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/integer-combinatorial/network-optimization","wordCount":1505,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"combinatorial-algorithms","title":"组合优化算法：NP-hard 问题的精确与近似策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/operations-research/integer-combinatorial/combinatorial-algorithms","wordCount":1431,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第2章-整数与组合优化\">第2章：整数与组合优化</h1><p>当决策变量必须是<strong>整数</strong>（是否选择某方案：0 或 1；生产件数：正整数），LP 的连续可行域被打碎成离散的格点，问题的复杂度从多项式跳跃到 NP-hard。整数与组合优化就是研究如何在这片离散空间中高效求最优解。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>关键概念</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"integer-programming\">整数规划与分支定界</a></td>\n<td>如何精确求解 IP？</td>\n<td>MIP、分支定界、Gomory 割平面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"network-optimization\">网络优化</a></td>\n<td>流量与路径如何最优？</td>\n<td>最短路、最大流、最小费用流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"combinatorial-algorithms\">组合优化算法</a></td>\n<td>NP-hard 问题怎么处理？</td>\n<td>TSP、近似算法、近似比保证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"整数规划与组合优化的关系\">整数规划与组合优化的关系</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    IP[整数规划 IP] --&gt;|0-1变量| BIP[0-1 整数规划]&#10;    IP --&gt;|混合| MIP[混合整数规划 MIP]&#10;    BIP --&gt;|集合覆盖/背包| CO[组合优化问题]&#10;    CO --&gt;|多项式可解| P类[P 类:MST, 最短路, 最大流]&#10;    CO --&gt;|NP-hard| NP类[NP-hard:TSP, VRP, Set Cover]&#10;    NP类 --&gt;|精确| BB[分支定界/割平面]&#10;    NP类 --&gt;|近似| Approx[近似算法]&#10;    NP类 --&gt;|启发式| Meta[元启发式]\">graph TD\n    IP[整数规划 IP] --&gt;|0-1变量| BIP[0-1 